    "text": "CHARACTER MOTION\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 1, CC 65 to 80\n   1 Character path\n   2 Character speed\n   3 Toward the lens\n   4 Who moves\n   5 Body in frame\n   6 Move temper\n   7 Spacing\n   8 Drawn on\n   9 Overshoot\n  10 Overlap\n  11 Path shape\n  12 Squash and stretch\n  13 Key poses per line\n  14 Mouth shapes\n  15 suite: Crossing\n  16 suite: Snappy cartoon\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 1, CC 81 to 82\n   1 suite: Grounded realism\n   2 pair: When a person approaches, the camera pushes in"
